# MathViz Animation Verification Checklist

- [ ] Navigate to the MathViz application (http://localhost:5173 or similar)
- [ ] Locate the "Diagnostics" category on the home screen
- [ ] Click on "Matrix Row Reduction" diagnostic test
- [ ] Observe and verify 'Eliminate' animation:
    - [ ] Rows 1 and 2 are highlighted correctly
    - [ ] Ghost cells arc between rows
    - [ ] Inline arithmetic is visible and crisp (no blur)
- [ ] Observe and verify 'Swap' animation:
    - [ ] Rows slide smoothly past each other
    - [ ] No layout flicker or 'remount' flash
- [ ] Observe and verify final transition to RREF:
    - [ ] Value changes are sharp
    - [ ] Scale-up transition used instead of blur
- [ ] Compile final report on animation clarity and smoothness
